Error [E0224]: This call writes `scores`, but `scores` has no `&` mark
  --> receiver_mark_collection_replace.jet:5:12
    |
  5 |     old :: scores.replace("ada", 9)
    |            ^^^^^^
 Why: The method is declared with `&self`, so the call writes the named place it is called on; the mark sits on that place, the same way `edit(&buf)` and `consume(^text)` mark arguments
 Fix: Write `&scores`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0224

Error [E0224]: This call writes `seen`, but `seen` has no `&` mark
  --> receiver_mark_collection_replace.jet:7:18
    |
  7 |     displaced :: seen.replace(2)
    |                  ^^^^
 Why: The method is declared with `&self`, so the call writes the named place it is called on; the mark sits on that place, the same way `edit(&buf)` and `consume(^text)` mark arguments
 Fix: Write `&seen`
